### Planovar API — Auth requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or import into Insomnia/Postman.
### Run the API first: make api-dev

@base = http://localhost:3000
@clientEmail = testclient@example.com
@vendorEmail = testvendor@example.com
@password = TestPass123!


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# REGISTRATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register a CLIENT user (use from client app context)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "name": "Amara Osei",
  "email": "{{clientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "CLIENT",
  "firstName": "Amara",
  "lastName": "Osei",
  "phone": "+2348012345678"
}

###

### Register a VENDOR user (use from vendor app context)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "name": "Chidi Events Co",
  "email": "{{vendorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "VENDOR",
  "firstName": "Chidi",
  "lastName": "Nwosu",
  "phone": "+2348087654321"
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# EMAIL VERIFICATION (OTP)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Step 1 — request OTP (OTP is printed to console in dev mode)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/email-otp/send-verification-otp
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "email": "{{clientEmail}}",
  "type": "email-verification"
}

###

### Step 2 — verify OTP (replace 000000 with the OTP from your console)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/email-otp/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "email": "{{clientEmail}}",
  "otp": "000000"
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# SIGN IN
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Sign in as client
# @name clientSignIn
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "email": "{{clientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

### Sign in as vendor
# @name vendorSignIn
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "email": "{{vendorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# SESSION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get current session (requires session cookie from sign-in above)
GET {{base}}/api/auth/get-session
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# SIGN OUT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Sign out
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-out
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# PASSWORD RESET
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Step 1 — request reset OTP
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forget-password
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "email": "{{clientEmail}}"
}

###

### Step 2 — reset password (replace token with value from email/console)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "newPassword": "NewPass456!",
  "token": "REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL"
}
